# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify _redirects file
# Format: <from>  <to>  <status>
# Netlify: this is duplicated by netlify.toml [[redirects]] but harmless.
# Cloudflare Pages: this is the ONLY way to declare redirects (no TOML equivalent).

# --- 301 redirects for retired blog posts ---
# The Hygraph CMS content was updated in Jul 2026: 9 old posts were removed and
# replaced with 4 new posts. These 301s preserve inbound-link equity by pointing
# the dead URLs at /blog (the listing page), which now shows the current 4 posts.
/blog/post/ai-agents                              /blog  301
/blog/post/aws-railway                            /blog  301
/blog/post/evo-2                                  /blog  301
/blog/post/graph-rag                              /blog  301
/blog/post/identity-missing-pillar-agentic-ai     /blog  301
/blog/post/jedilabs                               /blog  301
/blog/post/knowledge-graph                        /blog  301
/blog/post/ora-hackathon                          /blog  301
/blog/post/supabase-etl                           /blog  301

